=== L7-FRAG-01 (bổ đề 7, non-divisibility conclusion) — S5c + S6, 2026-09-27 ===
Closes the chunk that the 2026-09-26 restart left at S0-S5b with S6 = F4. The
F4 was withdrawn after scouting the main proof: bổ đề 7 is cited at p30 R2 (the
congruence conclusions) and p32 R1, where the case h = c^n cancels
a^n b^n (a^n − b^n)(a^n + b^n) ≢ 0 (mod n) to obtain its (27) — so the
statement's DIFFERENCE factor is what the main proof consumes, and the missing
instance is an F3 fill-in, not a sign error.

